Code.Terraform:
```hcl
resource "awscc_bedrockagentcore_code_interpreter_custom" "example" {
  name               = "<example_resource_name>"
  execution_role_arn = "<example_role_arn>"

  # Critical: VPC mode with subnets and security groups makes the check PASS (SANDBOX also passes)
  network_configuration {
    network_mode = "VPC"
    vpc_config {
      security_groups = ["<example_security_group_id>"]
      subnets         = ["<example_subnet_id>"]
    }
  }
}
```
